# Repository-recorded pin for the Hermes Agent source commit.
#
# docker/Dockerfile COPYs this file, parses its first non-comment value into
# the HERMES_COMMIT shell variable during the image build, and passes that
# exact value to the official Hermes installer as --commit. No Docker ARG
# or duplicated default carries this pin, so every image built from this
# repository checks out the exact same Hermes Agent commit until this file
# is deliberately updated.
#
# This is a source-content pin (which commit gets checked out), separate
# from hermes-installer.sha256 (which pins the installer *script* itself,
# independent of what it then checks out).
#
# Recorded: 2026-08-20, per explicit instruction to pin Hermes to this
# commit rather than floating main (BUILD_DIRECTIVE.md governs; this file
# is the traceable, single place that pin is recorded and configured from
# — see evidence/milestone-1/TASK.md).
#
# Update procedure: change the SHA below in its own reviewed commit. Do
# not float this to a branch name — --commit pins an exact revision.
044acf2bf700b8452e903f035406091146eb0245
